## Run

```
flutter pub get
flutter run
```

## Release

```
bash scripts/bump_version.sh 1.1.0
git commit -am "Release 1.1.0" && git push
```

CI builds the Android APKs and the Linux AppImages, then publishes them to GitHub Releases as `v1.1.0`. Installed copies find the new version through the `VERSION` file on `main`.

## Icons and fonts

Edit `assets/icons/icon_mocha.svg` and `icon_latte.svg`, then run `python3 scripts/generate_icons.py`.

After adding translations, rebuild the bundled fonts with `python3 scripts/subset_fonts.py --src <folder with the original Noto fonts>`.

See the flutter-base README for the structure and the conventions this project follows.
